        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion RH-D9, Bella Villa Wall Mounted Robe Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe ornateness of the Oval Floral Mount Robe Hook makes it an eye-catcher for sure. Add a bit of glamor to one of the most used rooms of the house with this easy to install bathroom robe hook; but do not let your imagination stop at the bathroom door. This hook is great for many rooms in your house. Install a few by the front door, for example, to catch bags, hats, and coats. Choose from 6 beautiful finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/oval-floral-towel-bar-fusion-tb-d9\"><b>Fusion TB-D9 Oval Floral Mount Towel Bar</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/oval-floral-mount-hand-towel-ring-fusion-tr-d9\"><b>Fusion TR-D9 Oval Floral Mount Towel Ring</b></a>, and\r\n<a href=\"/products/oval-floral-mount-toilet-paper-holder-fusion-ph-d9\"><b>Fusion PH-D9 Oval Floral Mount Toilet Paper Holder</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Fusion Oval Floral Trim Robe Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
